                           datasets, and, for clones, does not include the
                           space shared with the origin snapshot.  For snap‐
                           shots, the ccoommpprreessssrraattiioo is the same as the
                           rreeffccoommpprreessssrraattiioo property.  Compression can be
                           turned on by running: zzffss sseett ccoommpprreessssiioonn=oonn
                           _d_a_t_a_s_e_t.  The default value is ooffff.

